msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Gaan voort"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Add the following Tree Branch."
msgstr "Klik op 'Gaan voort' om die volgende boomtak by te voeg."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add to which Graph Tree?"
msgstr "Voeg by watter grafiekboom?"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "QuickTree has Created Tree and/or Branch and added Graphs"
msgstr "QuickTree het boom en/of tak geskep en grafieke bygevoeg"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "QuickTree has no Graphs Queued"
msgstr "QuickTree het geen grafieke in die tou nie"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Information/Directions"
msgstr "Inligting/Aanwysings"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "The Graphs below are Queue to be added to a Cacti Tree.  You may keep them here for as long as you like, or you can perform one of the following actions"
msgstr "Die grafieke hieronder is in die tou om by 'n Cacti-boom gevoeg te word. Jy kan hulle so lank as wat jy wil hier hou, of een van die volgende aksies uitvoer"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save your selection to a new Graph Tree so you can keep them for later and work on something new."
msgstr "Stoor jou keuse na 'n nuwe grafiekboom sodat jy dit vir later kan hou en aan iets nuuts kan werk."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save your selection as a branch to an existing tree so that they appear in a specific section of an existing tree."
msgstr "Stoor jou keuse as 'n tak van 'n bestaande boom sodat hulle in 'n spesifieke afdeling van 'n bestaande boom verskyn."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear all graphs"
msgstr "Maak alle grafieke skoon"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear the Graphs on this page from the Graphs Queue so that you have a blank QuickTree ready for new selections"
msgstr "Maak die grafieke op hierdie bladsy uit die grafiektou skoon sodat jy 'n leë QuickTree gereed het vir nuwe keuses"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "You can manage the individual graphs that appear here by clicking:"
msgstr "Jy kan die individuele grafieke wat hier verskyn bestuur deur te klik op:"

