msgid "This icon is next to a Graph on the %s tab."
msgstr "Hierdie ikoon is langs 'n grafiek op die %s-oortjie."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Skrap"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "This icon next to the Graphs below to remove them from the QuickTree Queue."
msgstr "Hierdie ikoon langs die grafieke hieronder om hulle uit die QuickTree-tou te verwyder."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Nota:"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Adding, removing or clearing on this page does not affect any other parts of Cacti (only Creating/Saving does)"
msgstr "Byvoeging, verwydering of skoonmaak op hierdie bladsy raak geen ander dele van Cacti nie (slegs skep/stoor doen dit)"

